    "CoiStatement": "S.S.S. and N.Z.P. are inventors on a utility PCT application \u201cPaper based diagnostic test\u201d (PCT/US2012/064856, 11/13/2012) claiming priority benefit of US 61/692,994 (8/24/2012) and US 61/558,009 (11/10/2011) []. S.S.S. is a part-owner of Halcyon Biomedical Incorporated, a company that may benefit from commercialization of the paper-based SCA test(s). All other authors declare no conflict of interest.",
    "Article": {
